// AWS EC2 Key Pair Created or Imported  [tier: hunt]  ATT&CK: T1098
// Detects creation or import of EC2 key pairs (CreateKeyPair/ImportKeyPair). Attackers add their own key material to retain SSH access to…
// False positives: Normal instance provisioning workflows.
// Source: rules/persistence/ec2-create-key-pair.yml — generated by scripts/build_dist.py; adjust field names to your CloudTrail schema.
(eventName in~ ("CreateKeyPair", "ImportKeyPair")) and eventSource =~ "ec2.amazonaws.com"
